    <bpmn:process id="W_W4892" name="W4892. Commercial Music Service / Background-Music Provider Selection &amp; Contracting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor model selected (W4889); contract expiry; expansion
Frequency: Per sourcing event + multi-year contract
Volume: ~1–3 commercial music/background-music providers group-wide
Owner: In-Store Media Manager / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34) / Legal (VS-100.3)
Participants: Music-service vendors, IT (VS-27), Finance (VS-17), TPRM (VS-161)
Source: workflow W4892 — Commercial Music Service / Background-Music Provider Selection &amp; Contracting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4892_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4892_Lane1" name="In-Store Media Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4892_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4892_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4892_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4892_Lane2" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4892_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4892_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4892_Start4" name="Vendor model selected (W4889); contract expiry; expansion">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4892_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4892_Task5" name="Define vendor requirements: licensed business-music catalog (clean-edit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define vendor requirements: licensed business-music catalog (clean-edit, OPM/Filipino content), zoned multi-channel delivery, central CMS/scheduling (W4890), dayparting, promo-interstitial insertion, in-store player hardware/software, offline resilience (store network outages per VS-27), uptime SLA, reporting/analytics, and the rights-clearance model (does the service&#x27;s blanket license cover BuildRight&#x27;s public performance, or is direct FILSCAP still required — W4891)
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / IT / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4892_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4892_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4892_Task6" name="Run sourcing &amp; contract: RFP, evaluate (catalog depth/localization/clean-edit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run sourcing &amp; contract: RFP, evaluate (catalog depth/localization/clean-edit coverage/commercial/uptime/TPRM cyber &amp; financial DD VS-161), negotiate (term/exit/SLA/price-per-site/data-sharing RA 10173 VS-91), and contract via Legal with TPRM provisions; confirm the rights-clearance allocation in writing
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal / TPRM / IT
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / Legal
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4892_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4892_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4892_Task7" name="Onboard: deploy the in-store player to 205 sites (W4896/W4906), integrate the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Onboard: deploy the in-store player to 205 sites (W4896/W4906), integrate the CMS to the DAM (VS-137) and store-comms (VS-63), set the royalty/license hand-off with W4891, and manage performance (W4910) and re-compete at term
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / IT / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Per partner + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4892_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4892_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4892_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4892_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
