Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Marketing Content
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Retail Media (VS-48), Store Ops (VS-07), IT/AV (VS-27/VS-138), DAM (VS-137)
Source: workflow W4893 — In-Store Digital Signage Content Strategy &amp; Programming</bpmn:documentation>
