      <bpmn:userTask id="W4893_Task5" name="Define the BuildRight-owned signage content strategy distinct from VS-48…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the BuildRight-owned signage content strategy distinct from VS-48 vendor-paid retail-media: brand/house content (welcome, category education, how-to, safety, wayfinding, price-integrity/RA 7394, PWD/senior discount notices VS-85), the BuildRight-vs-vendor-ad slot allocation, the screen zoning (entrance/aisle/checkout/pro-desk), and the content-production pipeline from the DAM (VS-137)
Responsible (R): Marketing Content / In-Store Media Manager / Retail Media
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4893_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4893_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4893_Task6" name="Program the signage playlist via the CMS (W4907/W4909): dayparting, promotional…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Program the signage playlist via the CMS (W4907/W4909): dayparting, promotional overlays (links VS-14/VS-58/VS-64), category-education loops, safety/wayfinding (links W4398), and the price/tag-compliance notices (links VS-151); coordinate the VS-48 vendor-ad slots so the two channels complement
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Retail Media / DAM
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4893_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4893_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4893_Task7" name="Localize &amp; publish: Filipino/regional-language and store-specific content…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Localize &amp; publish: Filipino/regional-language and store-specific content (links VS-14/W4903), schedule via W4899, and audit playback compliance (W4908/W4910); manage the content-asset library lifecycle in the DAM (VS-137)
Responsible (R): Marketing Content / DAM / Store Ops
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4893_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4893_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
