    <bpmn:process id="W_W4894" name="W4894. Ambient Scent &amp; Sensory Experience Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy set (W4889); pilot success; format refresh (VS-109)
Frequency: Per rollout + continuous operations
Volume: Select flagship/remodel sites (VS-109) × scent program
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Brand
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Store Ops (VS-07), Facilities (VS-138), HSE (VS-24), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4894 — Ambient Scent &amp; Sensory Experience Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4894_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4894_Lane1" name="Brand">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4894_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4894_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4894_Lane2" name="In-Store Media Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4894_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4894_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
