        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4894_Start4" name="Strategy set (W4889); pilot success; format refresh (VS-109)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4894_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4894_Task5" name="Define the sensory/scent strategy &amp; standards: the brand scent identity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the sensory/scent strategy &amp; standards: the brand scent identity (consistent with the warehouse/home-building positioning, avoiding clash with paint/chemical/garden live-goods odors VS-114/VS-145), zone application (entrance, paint aisle exclusion, garden), intensity, and the own-vendor vs in-house model
Responsible (R): Brand / CX / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4894_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4894_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4894_Task6" name="Select the scent vendor/equipment, pilot at flagship/remodel sites (VS-109)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Select the scent vendor/equipment, pilot at flagship/remodel sites (VS-109), and verify safety: SDS for fragrance oils (chemical-handling HSE VS-24/VS-114), indoor-air-quality/ventilation interaction (VS-138), and allergen/sensitivity considerations for customers and staff (RA 10173 health-data care); obtain HSE sign-off
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Vendor / HSE / Facilities
Accountable (A): In-Store Media Manager / HSE Lead
Duration: Per pilot</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4894_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4894_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4894_Task7" name="Roll out, operate, and measure: deploy dispensers, maintain via facilities…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Roll out, operate, and measure: deploy dispensers, maintain via facilities (VS-138/W4906), track CX/CSAT and basket impact (W4905), and manage the vendor contract/SLA (W4910); retire if neutral/negative
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Facilities / CX
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4894_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4894_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4894_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4894_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
