        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-734 (ensure controlled execution — In-Store Audio, Ambient Media Strategy &amp; Music Royalty Compliance (PA-168.1).) | - CTL-734: HSE sign-off (SDS/allergen); zone exclusion for chemical/garden aisles; pilot-gated rollout
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Brand</bpmn:text>
