      <bpmn:userTask id="W4895_Task5" name="Build the annual in-store-media budget: royalty/license (W4891), commercial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the annual in-store-media budget: royalty/license (W4891), commercial music service (W4892), signage content production (W4893), scent (W4894), AV equipment maintenance/refresh (W4906/W4910), and the per-site allowance; align to the marketing (VS-14) and capex (VS-40) plans
Responsible (R): Marketing Finance / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4895_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4895_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4895_Task6" name="Pursue vendor co-funding: structure BuildRight-vs-vendor signage slot…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Pursue vendor co-funding: structure BuildRight-vs-vendor signage slot allocation (W4893) so VS-48 retail-media and category vendors co-fund screens/content (links VS-48/VS-39 co-op), recover the royalty/service cost, and document the revenue/co-fund in the retail-media P&amp;L
Responsible (R): Retail Media / Finance / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4895_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4895_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4895_Task7" name="Track spend vs budget, manage variances, and report the in-store-media P&amp;L…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Track spend vs budget, manage variances, and report the in-store-media P&amp;L (cost vs co-fund recovery vs CX uplift) into the marketing FP&amp;A (VS-17.4) and corporate performance (VS-33.2)
Responsible (R): Marketing Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4895_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4895_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4895_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4895_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4895_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-734 (ensure controlled execution — In-Store Audio, Ambient Media Strategy &amp; Music Royalty Compliance (PA-168.1).) | - CTL-734: annual budget approved by CFO/CMO; co-fund governed by slot-allocation policy; variance reviewed monthly
Owner: In-Store Media Manager / Finance (VS-17.4) / Marketing Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4895_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4895_Annotation9" targetRef="W4895_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
