    <bpmn:process id="W_W4896" name="W4896. Multi-Entity / Multi-Region Ambient Media Standards &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program launch (W4889); 5-entity expansion; regional variance
Frequency: Annual + on entity/region change
Volume: 5 entities × multi-region (Mindanao/Visayas/Luzon/NCR) footprint
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Brand Governance
Participants: Marketing (VS-14), Store Ops Regional (VS-07), Legal (VS-100), Shared Services (VS-72), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4896 — Multi-Entity / Multi-Region Ambient Media Standards &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4896_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4896_Lane1" name="In-Store Media Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4896_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4896_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4896_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4896_Lane2" name="Brand">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4896_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4896_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4896_Start4" name="Program launch (W4889); 5-entity expansion; regional variance">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4896_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4896_Task5" name="Set the cross-entity ambient-media governance: group brand-sound/signage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the cross-entity ambient-media governance: group brand-sound/signage standards applied across the 5 entities (BuildRight Depot/Logistics/Digital Commerce/Property/Holdings), the entity-specific exceptions (DC will-call vs retail store vs HQ), the approval matrix for local-store/regional variance, and the centralized-vs-decentralized operating model
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Brand / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4896_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4896_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4896_Task6" name="Manage multi-region localization &amp; cultural variance: regional language/music…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage multi-region localization &amp; cultural variance: regional language/music preferences (Cebuano/Ilonggo/Bicolano/Waray/Tagalog, links W4903), local-store-event exceptions (barangay/fiesta, links W908/W1511), and consistent brand-sound while respecting regional identity
Responsible (R): Brand / Store Ops Regional / In-Store Media Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4896_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4896_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4896_Task7" name="Govern via shared services (VS-72): central content/royalty/asset management…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern via shared services (VS-72): central content/royalty/asset management with decentralized store execution, charge the in-store-media cost pool across entities (links VS-72), and report entity/regional compliance (W4908) and performance (W4905) to the group
Responsible (R): In-Store Media Manager / Shared Services / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4896_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4896_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4896_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4896_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4896_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-96 (ensure music-licensing &amp; audio compliance.) | - CTL-734: group standards + variance approval matrix; centralized royalty/asset management; fair cost chargeback (VS-72)
Owner: In-Store Media &amp; Brand-Experience Manager / Brand Governance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
